{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港中醫醫院介紹擴展服務安排。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中醫醫院營運機構董事局主席王桂壎說，中醫醫院將提供24小時中醫住院服務，而今年計劃推出12個專病項目。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T05:40:11.031269+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":67,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}